<title>POLAND: ZASADA SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZASADA SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.40 vs   3.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.93 vs   4.64</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.31 vs   6.81</p>
<p> Sales		   20.84 vs  32.34</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.05 vs   9.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.52 vs  13.99</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.95 vs  26.34</p>
<p> Sales		  261.79 vs 215.22</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish automotive group is Sobieslaw</p>
<p>Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
